  "solution": {
    "text": "Area of graph\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n=\\int \\mathrm{adx}=\\int \\frac{\\mathrm{vdv}}{\\mathrm{dx}} \\cdot \\mathrm{d} \\mathrm{x}==\\int_{\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{i}}}^{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{f}}} \\mathrm{v} \\mathrm{d} \\mathrm{v} \\\\\r\n=\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm{v}^{2}}{2}\\right]_{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{i}}}^{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{f}}}, 150+150=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\mathrm{~V}_{\\mathrm{f}}^{2}-\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{i}}^{2}\\right]\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n300 \\times 2=V_{f}^{2}-(5)^{2} \\\\\r\nV_{f}^{2}=600+25, V_{f}=25\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$"
